course: dictionary
lesson: 11327
title: One word, several meanings
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning. To find the right one, look at the words around it. The word yogi can name a person who practises yoga, a person who loves yoga, or a cartoon bear.
explain: «Winnie the Pooh and Yogi Bear are friendly and steal honey and picnic baskets» tells you that Yogi Bear is a character in a story, not someone doing yoga. Bears in stories steal honey and picnic baskets, so the clues point to the cartoon.
explain: In a lesson about India, yogi means someone who practises yoga a lot, often a teacher or a religious or spiritual person in Hinduism. Always check: put your meaning into the sentence and see if it still makes sense.
fact: A yogi is a person who practises yoga a lot.
fact: A yogi can be a teacher, or a religious or spiritual person in Hinduism.
fact: Informally, a yogi is someone who loves doing yoga.
fact: Yogi Bear is a cartoon bear who is friendly and steals picnic baskets.
fact: Yogi Berra was a famous American baseball player, and Yogi is also a name.
exercise: In a lesson on Hinduism, «The yogi sat quietly and taught the class about breathing.» What is a yogi here? | A famous American baseball player | *A person who practises yoga a lot, such as a teacher | A kind of sports shoe | A bear who steals picnic baskets
exercise: Ella says, «Yogi Bear loves honey.» Who is Yogi Bear? | A person who loves doing yoga | *A cartoon bear | A yoga teacher in Delhi | A real bear from the forest
exercise: Jayden says yogi always means a cartoon bear. Is he right? | Yes, it is only a baseball word | No, it means a very old castle | *No, yogi can also mean a person who practises yoga | Yes, it always means a cartoon bear
test: «The yogi had practised yoga every morning for thirty years.» What does yogi mean here? | A cartoon bear | *A person who practises yoga a lot | A famous baseball player | A kind of picnic basket
test: Mia says, «My cousin is a yogi; she loves doing yoga at the weekend.» What does yogi mean? | A famous baseball player | *Someone who loves doing yoga | A bear who steals honey | A kind of cave
exam: Which meaning of yogi fits «Winnie the Pooh and Yogi Bear are friendly and steal honey and picnic baskets»? | A teacher of yoga in India | A famous American baseball player | A person who loves doing yoga | *A cartoon bear, Yogi Bear
